fail fast saves lives

fail fast: detect fast, fix fast

contributes to pit of success
- tests alert unexpected behaviors at build time
- logs alert unexpected behaviors at monitor time

benefits:
- safer development: surprises flagged asap
- rapid maintenance: changes flagged asap in production

use:
```ts
import { MalfunctionError } from 'helpful-errors';
throw new MalfunctionError(message, metadata);
```
or
```ts
import { ConstraintError } from 'helpful-errors';
throw new ConstraintError(message, metadata);
```